    "2026-11-02: Independent clinical, optical-formula, and full-frame 1800x920 WebKit visual sign-off completed across all 13 Wave 1B SVGs (atlas-s02-08..12, atlas-s03-03..10) and BCSC S02/S03 chapters & 127 questions after verifying sulcus-IOL Table 7-1 powers, toric 2C·sinθ inputs, and zero text/border collisions.",
    "2026-11-02 targeted correction, not a full re-review: atlas-s02-12 (no CT for suspected retinoblastoma, ERIC guideline) and atlas-s03-07 (residual toric axis at 30 degrees misalignment). Hashes refreshed for these two units only.",
